									<th>Name</th>
									<th>Status</th>
									<th>Notes</th>
								</tr>
							</thead>
							<tbody>
								<tr>
									<td>John</td>
									<td>Approved</td>
									<td>He is a very nice guy and I enjoyed talking to him on the telephone. I hope we get to talk again.</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td>Jamie</td>
									<td>Approved</td>
									<td>Jamie was not interested in purchasing our product.</td>
